# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# CTRI — environment variables
#
# The app runs with none of these set. They are here for when you want to pin
# the session secret or move off the built-in storage.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Signs session cookies and one-time invite links.
# If unset, a secret is generated on first boot and persisted in Netlify Blobs.
# Set it explicitly to keep sessions valid across a store reset, and rotate it
# to sign every member out at once.
# Generate with: node -e "console.log(require('crypto').randomBytes(32).toString('base64url'))"
# SESSION_SECRET=
